    Shared cost-check-and-pay helper: compares a cost (ax) against `_gold` (`[di+0x23]`) via a swap-compare-swap trick (no spare register clobbered); if gold < cost, returns immediately (carry set, insufficient funds); otherwise BCD-subtracts the cost from `_gold` (double-byte `sub`/`das`/`sbb`/`das`, flooring to 0 on any residual underflow) and returns with carry clear.
